
## Decision

**Keep positioning limited to attendance and absence workflow. Do not position clinical placement or rotation management.**

Lyon has verified clinical rotations, but that establishes a workflow context, not a verified placement-management need. The governing M9 guardrail remains in force pending Kib’s resolution of an internal playbook conflict.

